{"id":"02e504ae-3b0b-4d67-80fd-680b69889a35","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244779,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Add p33 game-theory details to the multi_agent note while it is visible.\",\"code\":\"n=write_note(title='multi_agent',content='p33 博弈论研究：LLaMa2/GPT3.5 比人类更合作、宽容；LLaMa3 除非对手总合作否则不合作且剥削。Akata 2025 让 GPT-3/3.5/4 玩重复博弈，在利己有利处（迭代囚徒困境）表现好，在需协调处（性别之战）差；GPT-4 对对手信息与预测提示敏感。抽象战略推理最强为 LLaMa-2，其次 GPT-4，GPT-3.5 几乎无。GTBench 覆盖井字棋、四子棋、Kuhn 扑克、Liar’s Dice 等：LLM 在完全确定性博弈失败、在概率博弈有竞争力；开源模型多弱于 GPT-4；代码预训练有利战略推理，CoT/ToT 不一定有帮助。EgoSocialArena 测认知/情境/行为智能，所有模型（含 o1-preview）落后人类 11%，模型规模对社会智能帮助不大，第一人称视角优于第三人称的心智理论推理。',evidence_ids=['ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186'],section='multi_agent')\\nprint(n.get('note_id'),n.get('chars'))\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186\"]}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":7326,"completion_tokens":323,"total_tokens":7649,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":2846},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}